+### 3.4 Hybrid Note Picker Sheet (`Features/Editing/NotePickerSheet.swift`)
+
+1. **Header**: Shows current track drum name (e.g. "Kick") and MIDI note number (e.g. "36 / C1").
+2. **Segmented Mode Switch**:
