+   - **View 2: Piano Roll Keyboard**: Scrollable 2-octave mini piano keyboard with key labels ($C0..B7$). Tapping key plays preview hit & assigns `midi_note`.
+3. **Submission**: Submits `Command.setTrackNote(trackIdx:midiNote:)`.
